男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241208/942414415293190144718024.png/JzXUlOfscvitif-00MsR-Lrdth2bxzXnaozjjGqM44w\"/><figcaption>男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241208/942414417134620672153406.png/qRmYOG7ZdBcjWW2TMz7oqiPsiMIr_NJtqCtdd6grXXc\"/><figcaption>男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241208/942414418997022720543029.png/sLSqDqojcgzX0DU18agvV0FYmlJ5oRbL9RCp-fUQqfk\"/><figcaption>男友瞓覺散發「屍臭味」　女子感困擾PO文詢問　網友笑言：男友可能係殭屍（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>也有網友批評原PO：</p><p>「你根本不愛她」</p><p>「愛她就帶她去看醫生」</p><p>「想辦法讓她知道啊，不說她也不知道你在意的點」</p><p>不能因為一次親密接觸不如預期，就開始逃避對方。</p><p>根據世界衛生組織（WHO）資料，全球約23%至29%的育齡女性有細菌性陰道炎，主要與陰道菌叢失衡有關，可能出現分泌物異常、魚腥味等症狀。不過，私密處有異味不一定代表感染，也不能單憑氣味判斷病因，若異味持續或伴隨搔癢、灼熱等症狀，建議就醫檢查。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：性愛冷知識︱做愛前挖鼻孔會更開心？味道好重要有阿婆味會冇性慾】挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754516089671680210897.jpeg/7ziDx7Fn-zGDdTvEMjnSEh9S74we_HO0gSuXb4Erl28\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：性愛冷知識︱做愛前挖鼻孔會更開心？味道好重要有阿婆味會冇性慾】挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754518426030080207314.jpeg/5vSBbDhaXSlKWRKFe_wrEXYg9iclzZ3r6we8zOsHvMw\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754521014046720198270.jpeg/zwQxv9xMV2iroh1Romsm2c8Vdjdj-bDulNmUIpTZlCI\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754523375570944372089.jpeg/MjSgL3y4vBTTYZNt-OR6uTstXfXtSShwEtBbkhLQW5I\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754525552545792273841.jpeg/gZvmBGOxcaKHjQ_Rq1JeXgaoB4w4t-7x00-LitNPi4o\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754528048287744180396.jpeg/yhdL4773WZzrGGUPf4blk3xn0Sz9Ep7K9HX9N_R1_Tc\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by George Coletrain on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754530636304384104895.jpeg/8I9j9xrLEakhyk00ItrjBJCaCscDk1H6dfhgDHX4YAw\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by We-Vibe WOW Tech on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754532762947584286709.jpeg/P0E7wdJ9XTd5d37XwzfZobmlZ3nUo4YEl1DR3pdQ0d4\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by We-Vibe WOW Tech on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by We-Vibe WOW Tech on Unsplash）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210303/443754534864424960624039.jpeg/4AV3U-PY9746OwLKEVcCW5iqU_PR1kiBTIwxykyMMco\"/><figcaption>挖乾淨鼻孔做愛比較爽？（01製圖/Photo by We-Vibe WOW Tech on Unsplash）</figcaption></figure><p>從沒告訴女友住哪…她竟突現身家中 40歲男嫌進展快想分手反遭網轟</p><p>男友偷吃高中閨密還不夠…兩人竟聯手「幹一事」 讓女好崩潰</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:52:54.960751+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1762,"images":25,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:30:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T22:53:08.613717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:46:29.656607+00:00","c